text I trudge along.
text I'm out of places to search. All I can do now is hope that Sanae-san comes up with something.
text I see the small umbrella again, still in the same place.
text I stop and stare for a while.
text Suddenly, I hear the whimper of an animal close to my ears.
text Caught by surprise, I look beside me to find a puppy on top of the wall.
text It's soaked and shaking. It probably can't get down.
text I reach out and hold it up.
text It has a collar on. I see, I think.
text As the child approaches me, I hold out the puppy.
text @[Tomoya]
text Is this what you were looking for?
text The child glances up and quickly breaks into a smile.
sound GYM.aac
text @[Children]
text Oh, that's great! Where was he?
text @[Tomoya]
text Over there.
text I apathetically point toward the wall, then start to leave.
sound GYN.aac
text @[Children]
text Oh, wait.
text He calls out for me to stop. To thank me? I don't even care about that, it's a pain. I decide to ignore the words.
sound GYO.aac
text @[Children]
text Do you know where that big sis is?
text But his wording makes me turn around.
text @[Tomoya]
text Who are you talking about?
sound GYP.aac
text @[Children]
text Big sis. She's helping me find him.
text @[Tomoya]
text Are you talking about your own sister?
sound GYQ.aac
text @[Children]
text No, I don't know who she is. But she said she'd help me look.
text @[Tomoya]
text Was she wearing a school uniform?
sound GYR.aac
text @[Children]
text Um... I think.
text @[Tomoya]
text Which way did she go?
sound GYS.aac
text @[Children]
text Umm... I don't know.
sound GYT.aac
text @[Children]
text But she said she'd come back here once she found him.
text @[Tomoya]
text I see...
sound GYU.aac
text @[Children]
text What should I do...?
text He sounds worried as he pats the puppy's head.
text @[Tomoya]
text You oughta go home.
sound GYV.aac
text @[Children]
text Huh?
text @[Tomoya]
text It's late, your parents are probably worried.
text @[Tomoya]
text You'll catch a cold if you stay in the rain any longer. The same goes for that dog.
sound GYW.aac
text @[Children]
text Umm... but...
text @[Tomoya]
text I'll thank her for you, so get going.
sound GYX.aac
text @[Children]
text Really?
text @[Tomoya]
text Yup.
sound GYY.aac
text @[Children]
text Thanks. Promise me you will, okay?
text @[Tomoya]
text Yeah, leave it to me.
sound GYZ.aac
text @[Children]
text See ya.
text @[Tomoya]
text Yeah. Be careful not to slip.
text I can hear the splish-splash of the child's footsteps as he runs off.
text What an innocent kid.
text @[Tomoya]
text All right, then...
text When is she going to give up and come back?
text My only option is to wait.
